## 2. Current Architecture (snapshot)

```
PTY/agent stdout
   └─► main process: agent event parser
         └─► IPC: window.api.chat.onEvent
               └─► useChatSession (renderer)
                     └─► chatTimelineReducer (chat-timeline.ts)
                           └─► state.timeline: TimelineItem[]
                                 └─► ChatPanel (1011 LOC)
                                       ├─► useStickToBottom(scrollRef, contentRef)
                                       ├─► useVirtualizer(scrollRef, measureElement)
                                       └─► renderTimelineItem switch
                                             └─► renderers.tsx (per-kind components)
                                                   └─► GhMarkdown → react-markdown + rehype-raw
```

### Observed pain points (verified in code)

| # | Issue | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
